   "text": "max_tokens is a CEILING, not a bill \u2014 you pay for tokens generated.\nLowering _SCEN_MAX_TOKENS=128000 truncates JSON mid-array and silently\nfalls back to the heuristic. Do not \"optimize\" it.",
